{"seq":2,"slug":"the-cost-of-underspecification","title":"含糊规格的代价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/spec-driven-development-with-ai/why-spec-driven-with-ai/the-cost-of-underspecification","wordCount":2081,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"含糊规格的代价\">含糊规格的代价</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>AWS Kiro 的文档里有一个值得玩味的功能名：<strong>Analyze Requirements</strong>——官方描述是「Catch inconsistencies, ambiguities, and gaps in your requirements before design」（<a href=\"https://kiro.dev/docs/specs/\">Kiro Specs 文档</a>）。一个商业工具把「需求里的含糊」当成需要专门功能去抓的一等工程问题，说明欠定义（underspecification）不是文风瑕疵，而是会直接烧钱的生产事故源。AI 时代它的代价还被放大了：AI 不读心，面对含糊不会停下来说「这里我不确定」，而是用训练先验自信地把空白填满——猜对了皆大欢喜，猜错了你得到一大段看似完整却不是你要的代码。本节拆开这笔账：猜测如何发生、为什么 AI 让含糊更贵、以及为什么说清楚是省钱而非花钱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>欠定义（underspecification）</strong>：需求中没有被显式界定的维度——AI 会用自己的先验把这些维度填满，而填充值往往不是你要的。</li>\n<li><strong>沉默即授权</strong>：不追问、不标记、直接补全是模型在单轮生成下的默认行为；你的沉默被解读成「怎样都行」。</li>\n<li><strong>代价的乘法结构</strong>：含糊越多，猜错概率越高；依赖链越长，单次猜错牵连的下游任务越多——两项相乘即返工规模。</li>\n<li><strong>澄清前移</strong>：与其在返工循环里空转，不如在歧义源处花钱关掉它——说清楚是省钱而非花钱。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>后续三节分别回答：猜测如何发生、为什么要价更高、以及这笔账怎么算才划算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ai-会用猜测填补空白\">AI 会用猜测填补空白</h2><p>默认的单轮生成模式下，模型的行为是「继续往下做」而非「追问」：按训练数据里最常见的解释补全你没说清的部分，并且不用任何标记区分哪些是它的猜测。你的沉默被解读为「怎样都行」，而含糊处的默认值往往不是你的默认值——它合理地猜，恰好错过你真正要的。</p>\n<p>行业对此的反应本身就是证据：如果这不是普遍痛点，工具链不会为「澄清」专门设计机制。Spec Kit 的 assess 扩展把一个原始想法走完 intake → research → define → shape → decide 五步，产出明确的 <strong>go / needs-clarification / kill</strong> 决策（<a href=\"https://github.com/github/spec-kit\">Spec Kit README</a>）——「需要澄清」被制度化为三种合法结论之一，而不是靠开发者自觉。更常用的解毒剂是 EARS（Easy Approach to Requirements Syntax），Kiro 的 <code>requirements.md</code> 就用它来保证需求「structured, testable」，句式是：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"WHEN [condition/event]&#10;THE SYSTEM SHALL [expected behavior]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>WHEN [condition/event]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>THE SYSTEM SHALL [expected behavior]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>官方示例：「WHEN a user submits a form with invalid data / THE SYSTEM SHALL display validation errors next to the relevant fields」。Kiro 文档列出这个格式的四个收益：Clarity、Testability、Traceability、Completeness——最后一条尤其关键：逐条件枚举的格式会逼你想出那些原本没想到的条件（<a href=\"https://kiro.dev/docs/specs/feature-specs/\">Feature Specs</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>未界定的维度</th>\n<th>AI 的典型填充</th>\n<th>关掉它的规格手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>错误路径</td>\n<td>只实现 happy path</td>\n<td>用 WHEN/IF 子句逐条件枚举异常输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边界值</td>\n<td>取最常见的行业约定</td>\n<td>在规格里显式写出边界与取舍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>改动半径</td>\n<td>自行决定顺手改多少</td>\n<td>bugfix 规格三段式：current/expected/unchanged</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非功能约束</td>\n<td>忽略或过度设计</td>\n<td>把性能与安全预算写成 SHALL 子句</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三行是 Kiro 的原生实践：bugfix 规格要求在 <code>bugfix.md</code> 里写清 current / expected / unchanged behavior（<a href=\"https://kiro.dev/docs/specs/\">Types of Specs</a>），unchanged 一栏就是用来封住「顺手重构」这类未经授权的猜测。而一份完整规格应包含哪些要素才能把空白全部封住，见<a href=\"../writing-good-specs/anatomy-of-a-spec\">一份规格的构成</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ai-放大了欠定义的代价\">AI 放大了欠定义的代价</h2><p>同样的含糊，放在人肉开发里是「做错了改一改」，放在 AI 开发里是三个乘法效应。</p>\n<p><strong>错得更快更多。</strong> 一个含糊的需求几分钟内就能变成一大段错误代码；过去人慢慢写还有中途反应的机会，现在错误以更大体量更快到达。软件工程的老结论——缺陷修复成本随发现阶段后移而陡增（Boehm 在 <em>Software Engineering Economics</em> (1981) 中的经典发现）——在生成速度提升后被进一步放大：错误到达得越快，等你看见它时堆在上面的东西越多。</p>\n<p><strong>「看起来对」最难防。</strong> AI 的产出语法正确、结构完整、注释齐全。明显写坏的代码一眼可辨，精致但跑偏的代码会通过所有表面检查，直到验收阶段才暴露——那时它已经获得了最多的下游信任。</p>\n<p><strong>错误沿依赖链放大。</strong> 这一条有具体的机制：Kiro 执行 <code>tasks.md</code> 时会给任务建依赖图，把无依赖的任务分进 Wave 1 并发执行，后续 wave 依次展开（<a href=\"https://kiro.dev/docs/specs/\">Task Execution</a>）。效率很高，但反过来看，一个被误解的需求会沿着这条依赖图传播给每一个下游任务。返工面不再是一个文件，而是整张图。</p>\n<p>用一个概念模型把账算清楚（这是思考工具，不是实证公式）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>总</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>澄清</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{总}} = c_{\\text{澄清}} + p(\\delta)\\cdot(R_0 + n\\cdot r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">总</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">澄清</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是未界定的维度数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(\\delta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是猜错的概率（随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 单调上升），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是返工的基础成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是受牵连的下游任务数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是每个任务的修正成本。关键在两个导数：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>δ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial C/\\partial \\delta &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 且随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 增大——含糊越多越贵，且结构越复杂含糊越贵。前移澄清等于在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 还小的时候花掉 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>澄清</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{澄清}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">澄清</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，买断后面整个乘积项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"说清楚是省钱而非花钱\">说清楚是省钱而非花钱</h2><p>最有说服力的证据来自工具设计的细节：Kiro 连最激进的快速通道都不敢跳过澄清。Quick Spec 模式一口气生成 requirements/design/tasks 三工件、不设阶段审批门，但它的前提仍然是「You answer clarifying questions up front and land directly on the task list」（<a href=\"https://kiro.dev/docs/specs/quick-spec/\">Quick Spec</a>）——自动化可以砍掉审批，不能砍掉澄清，因为经验证砍不掉的那部分才是真正的成本底线。</p>\n<p>省钱的三条路径都很具体。第一，<strong>前期澄清替换后期返工</strong>：对应上面的公式，就是用小的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>澄清</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{澄清}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">澄清</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 消掉大概率的大额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(R_0 + n\\cdot r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。第二，<strong>一次说清替换多轮纠偏</strong>：Spec Kit 的 implement 之后要跑 <code>/speckit-converge</code> 对照规格检查，不收敛就再来一轮（<a href=\"https://github.com/github/spec-kit\">Bug Fixing with Spec Kit</a>）——收敛环是必要的兜底，但每一环都是完整的重新生成周期，前置精度决定你要转几圈。第三，<strong>写规格本身帮你发现没想清楚的地方</strong>：EARS 的 Completeness 收益说的就是这个——写不出某条件的 SHALL 子句，往往说明你自己还没决定那个条件下系统该干什么，这正好是在写代码之前该知道的事。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;含糊的需求&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;AI 用先验补全空白&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;实现沿依赖图传播&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;配套测试与文档按同一误解生成&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{&quot;何时发现跑偏&quot;}&#10;    E -- &quot;验收时&quot; --&gt; F[&quot;大范围返工&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; A&#10;    B -.-&gt;|&quot;EARS 子句关闭歧义&quot;| G[&quot;意图定稿&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;生成即对齐&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"含糊的需求\"] --&gt; B[\"AI 用先验补全空白\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"实现沿依赖图传播\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"配套测试与文档按同一误解生成\"]\n    D --&gt; E{\"何时发现跑偏\"}\n    E -- \"验收时\" --&gt; F[\"大范围返工\"]\n    F --&gt; A\n    B -.-&gt;|\"EARS 子句关闭歧义\"| G[\"意图定稿\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"生成即对齐\"]</pre><p>虚线那条边就是全部方法论：与其让流程在 F→A 的循环里空转，不如在 B 处就把歧义源关掉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><p>几个可以直接搬走的操作件：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>起草验收标准用 EARS 句式</strong>：每条行为写成 <code>WHEN &lt;条件&gt; THE SYSTEM SHALL &lt;行为&gt;</code>，写不出来说明条件还没想全，先别开工；判据怎么配正反例、设质量门，见<a href=\"../writing-good-specs/acceptance-criteria-and-examples\">验收标准与示例</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>提交生成前过一遍四问清单</strong>：矛盾、歧义、冲突约束、缺口——这正是 Kiro Analyze Requirements 抓的四类问题（<a href=\"https://kiro.dev/docs/specs/\">Analyze Requirements</a>），没有该工具就用这四个词当人工 checklist。</li>\n<li><strong>修 bug 用三段式描述</strong>：current / expected / unchanged 各一段，unchanged 明确圈出禁改区，堵住「顺手优化」。</li>\n<li><strong>高风险改动先进 plan mode</strong>：<code>claude --permission-mode plan</code> 或会话中 <code>Shift+Tab</code>，方案在落盘前必须过人审（<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/common-workflows\">Common workflows</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>「要不要做」也规格化</strong>：想法阶段的投入方向交给结构化评估——assess 扩展的 intake → research → define → shape → decide 流程输出 go / needs-clarification / kill 三态决策，避免把含糊的想法直接喂给生成环节。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>AI 面对含糊不追问、只填空，且填得笃定；生成速度与任务依赖图又把每次猜错的代价放大成整片返工。工具链把澄清制度化——EARS 句式、分析步骤、plan mode、三态决策——恰恰证明省不掉的就是这一步。说清楚不是开销，是把成本花在最便宜处。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"含糊规格的代价","id":"含糊规格的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"AI 会用猜测填补空白","id":"ai-会用猜测填补空白"},{"level":2,"text":"AI 放大了欠定义的代价","id":"ai-放大了欠定义的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"说清楚是省钱而非花钱","id":"说清楚是省钱而非花钱"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"从代码优先到意图优先","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/spec-driven-development-with-ai/why-spec-driven-with-ai/from-code-first-to-intent-first"},"next":{"title":"规格作为真理源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/spec-driven-development-with-ai/why-spec-driven-with-ai/spec-as-source-of-truth"}}